# type: English summary, imperative, no full stop, ≤72 chars
#
# English body. Explain WHY, not just what — the diff already says what.
# What was it like before, what broke, what does this change let someone do?
# If you found a real problem while doing something else, say so here; that is
# often the most valuable line in the commit.
#
# ---
# 中文说明：同样的内容，中文再写一遍。
# 英文在前、中文在后，这样历史整体看上去以英文为主，适合面向全世界的开源社区。
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# type: feat | fix | docs | refactor | test | ci | chore | security | release
#
# ⛔ No Co-Authored-By trailer in this repository. / 本仓提交不带 Co-Authored-By。
#
# Enable this template once per clone:
#   git config commit.template .gitmessage
